"""make_todo.py: tl_p1.json + tl_p2.json + todo_trial.py (the TRIAL staging, 22 Nov) + the notes below -> SCENES_TODO.md (the artist's list for Stage 2 of EP14).
  python3 make_todo.py      Re-run after any timeline change, so the times in the list are always the timeline's.
Every scene carries the teacher's 22 Nov visual standard, written out: what each buddy does (a fresh pose or reaction on every line, cute and
alive), how the camera moves (a gentle push or drift; no needless cuts: in the same place, move the camera), what small life is in the
background, and the light."""
